  BoneDig2SE3
  BoneDig2SE4
endmap

map BoneDig2ME90 -proj [elevation 90]
  BoneDig2SE90_1
  BoneDig2SE90_2
  BoneDig2SE90_3
  BoneDig2SE90_4
endmap

equate 2.3 2.25

